/p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 3<sup>-3</sup> = কত?", "option1": "ক) 1/9", "option2": "খ) 1/3", "option3": "গ) 1/27", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>3<sup>-3</sup> =1/3<sup>3</sup> = 1/27</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) log<sub>x</sub>(1/27) = -3 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 1/3", "option4": "ঘ) -1/3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>log<sub>x</sub>(1/27) = -3<br />বা, x<sup>-3</sup> = 1/3<sup>3</sup><br />&there4;x = 3</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) a<sup>x</sup>=y হলে নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?", "option1": "ক) y = log<sub>x</sub>a", "option2": "খ) x = log<sub>a</sub>y", "option3": "গ) a = log<sub>x</sub>y", "option4": "ঘ) x = log<sub>y</sub>a", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x = log<sub>a</sub>y<br />a<sup>x</sup> =y</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 400 এর log সমান 4 হলে এর ভিত্তি কত?", "option1": "ক) 10", "option2": "খ) e", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 2&radic;5", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>log<sub>a</sub>400 =4<br />&rArr;a<sup>4</sup>=400<br />&rArr;a<sup>4</sup> = (2&radic;5)<sup>4</sup><br />&there4;a=2&radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) log<sub>b</sub>a<sup>2</sup>.log<sub>c</sub>b<sup>2</sup>.log<sub>a</sub>c<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>log<sub>b</sub>a<sup>2</sup>.log<sub>c</sub>b<sup>2</sup>.log<sub>a</sub>c<sup>2</sup><br />=2log<sub>b</sub>a.2log<sub>c</sub>b.2log<sub>a</sub>c<br />= 4 log<sub>c</sub>a.2log<sub>a</sub>c<br />=8</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) ৬৪ এর ২ ভিত্তিক লগারিদম কত?", "option1": "ক) ৫", "option2": "খ) ৪", "option3": "গ) ৩", "option4": "ঘ) ৬", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>log<sub>2</sub>64= log<sub>2</sub>2<sup>6</sup>=6</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 3log2 + log5 = কত?", "option1": "ক) log30", "option2": "খ) log40", "option3": "গ) 3log7", "option4": "ঘ) log13", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3log2 + log5<br />=log2<sup>3</sup> + log5<br />=log8+log5<br />=log(8